006,571]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="1" text="This itinerary balances Kyoto's iconic cultural sites with interactive and engaging activities suitable for the whole family. It is designed to be flexible, allowing for relaxed pacing and spontaneous discoveries. Public transportation is highly recommended for getting around the city." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,597][1006,855]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="2" text="Daily Itinerary &amp; Activities" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,881][601,936]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="3" text="Day 1: Eastern Kyoto's Temples &amp; Traditions" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,962][756,1004]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="4" text="• Morning: Start at Fushimi Inari Shrine. Kids will love walking through the thousands of vibrant red torii gates that wind up the mountain. You don't need to hike the entire trail; even the lower loops are impressive." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,1030][1006,1198]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="5" text="• Afternoon: Head to Kiyomizu-dera Temple, famous for its wooden stage that offers panoramic views of the city. Afterwards, wander down the charming Sannenzaka and Ninenzaka preserved streets, filled with shops and snack stalls." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,1214][1006,1424]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="6" text="• Evening: Explore the historic Gion district. While spotting a geisha is rare, the traditional architecture and atmosphere are captivating. Enjoy dinner in the area." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,1440][1006,1566]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="7" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,1593][666,1719]" drawing-order="0" hint=""><node index="0" text="Explore Higashiyama Map" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[137,1632][603,1679]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="1" text="" resource-id="" class="android.widget.Button" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" chec